Package: omp-send-context-firefox-host
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18.0.0), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Firefox native messaging host for OMP Send Context
 Installs the Linux native messaging host used by the OMP Send Context
 Firefox add-on. System Firefox uses the packaged manifest; Snap and
 Flatpak Firefox users can register a per-user manifest with the included
 omp-send-context-install-firefox-host command.
